{"articleNo":"315621","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=315621&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] [지역선도대학 육성사업] 2021년 지역인재육성 집중캠프 학생 모집 안내(첨부 수정)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.07.12","hit":"10126","attachments":[{"name":"지역인재육성_집중캠프_학생_안내(안).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=315621&attachNo=102183"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><font face=\"돋움\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">[지역선도대학 육성사업] 지역인재육성 집중캠프</span></b></font></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><font face=\"돋움\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></span></b></font></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><font face=\"돋움\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">지역선도대학 육성사업의 일환으로 개인의 어학 및 한국사의 기초 능력을 파악하고 결과를 통한 집중적인 교육으로&nbsp;</span></span></font><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">단시간, 고효율의 학습 기회 제공 및 취업 역량을 강화하고자 하계방학 기간 중 지역인재육성 집중캠프 모집 공고를 다음과 같이 안내하오니, 학생들의 많은 지원 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><br></span></div><div><font face=\"돋움\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1. 프로그램명: 지역인재육성 집중캠프</span></font></div><div><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">2. 신청기한: 2021. 7. 13.(화) ~ 2021. 7. 14.(수) 12시까지&nbsp;</span></font></div><div><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">3. 장소: 동양대학교(영주캠퍼스)</span></font></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">4.대상:금오공대 학부 및 대학원 재학생(학과 및 자격요건 무관)</span><br></div><div><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">5.신청방법:&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold;\">네이버 폼</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><a href=\"http://naver.me/xYQsrUhL\" style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">http://naver.me/xYQsrUhL</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></a><span style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold;\">으로 신청 접수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [</span><span style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold;\">붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold;\">1 </span><span style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold;\">신청서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold;\">], [</span><span style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold;\">붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold;\">2 </span><span style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold;\">개인정보수집이용 동의서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold;\">] </span><span style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold;\">수기 작성하여&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;\">&nbsp;</span><u style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">PDF </span></u><u style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">파일 첨부로 이메일 제출</span></u><u style=\"text-indent: -24.1pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(progb@kumoh.ac.kr)</span></u></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; ※ 네이버 폼과 신청서는 변경없이 정확히 기재</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">6. 세부내용: 첨부파일 참조</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">7. 문의처: 지역선도대학육성사업팀 (054-478-7994)</span><br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
